**What landed (commit `578f9e2`):**
- New `scripts/ralph/skills/coherence_pass/coherence_pass.md` skill — read-only auditor that walks `course.json` + every lesson JSON and emits a markdown report with three named sections (`## Prerequisite Order`, `## Redundancy`, `## Notation Consistency`).
- Pipeline integration in `src/lib/server/generation.ts`: after the per-lesson loop succeeds and every lesson is on disk + valid (US-139 gate), `runCoherencePass()` spawns the skill, captures raw stdout, writes `/courses/<slug>/coherence-report.md`, and emits `stage:started` + terminal `stage:done` (or `stage:error` on failure).
- The `done` GenerationEvent now carries `coherenceReportPath?: 'coherence-report.md'` only on success — absent when the stage fails or is skipped.
- RALPH-mode (`RALPH_TASK_ID` / `RALPH_DEADLINE_EPOCH` / `RALPH_ITERATION` env) caps the spawn at 30s and writes the `Coherence pass timed out — re-run generation to retry.\n` placeholder when the cap trips.
- 5 new tests covering: skill-prompt shape, happy path (3-lesson course, report written, ordering, completion summary), non-zero failure (no report, course still completes), skipped on partial coverage (any lesson failed → no spawn), RALPH timeout placeholder.

**Verification:** `npm run typecheck` clean. `npm test` 766/766 (was 761; +5 for this story).

